{"id": "public-009", "category": "code_location", "question": "Owner.addVisit 中怎样定位宠物并把 Visit 交给它？", "answerable": true, "valid_at": null, "gold_answer": "先调用 getPet(petId)，再调用 pet.addVisit(visit)。", "required_facts": ["getPet(petId)", "pet.addVisit(visit)"], "gold_evidence": [{"source": "corpus/petclinic/Owner.java", "start_line": 181, "end_line": 181, "quote": "\t\tPet pet = getPet(petId);"}, {"source": "corpus/petclinic/Owner.java", "start_line": 185, "end_line": 185, "quote": "\t\tpet.addVisit(visit);"}], "expected_entities": ["petclinic.Owner.addVisit"], "expected_relations": []}
