{"id": "public-015", "category": "cross_document", "question": "Owner.addVisit 把就诊记录交给 Pet 后，Pet.addVisit 最终做了什么？", "answerable": true, "valid_at": null, "gold_answer": "Owner 调用 pet.addVisit(visit)，Pet 再调用 getVisits().add(visit) 加入就诊集合。", "required_facts": ["pet.addVisit(visit)", "getVisits().add(visit)"], "gold_evidence": [{"source": "corpus/petclinic/Owner.java", "start_line": 185, "end_line": 185, "quote": "\t\tpet.addVisit(visit);"}, {"source": "corpus/petclinic/Pet.java", "start_line": 82, "end_line": 82, "quote": "\t\tgetVisits().add(visit);"}], "expected_entities": ["petclinic.Owner.addVisit", "petclinic.Pet.addVisit"], "expected_relations": []}
